IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `br-core`
IMPORT `br6-seat`

-- br6-cases-seat.l4 -- worked cases for the seat of piece br6 (br6-seat.l4): at least one case per question, with the facts a shareholder would state.
-- Expected values come from the text of lei-6404-1976.pt.txt (a converter's plain-text rendering, not the official text), never from the output of the code:
-- each was decided from the text before the run. A question that can return NOTHING for the facts a shareholder states has a case that asserts it; the one that cannot (art. 217, where the person is fixed to the shareholder) has its NOTHING asserted in br6-tests-cap17.l4.


